@startuml
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Active : Reporter submits
Draft --> Removed : Admin removes
Active --> Matched : Potential match found
Active --> Expired : Expiry policy
Active --> Removed : Admin removes
Matched --> Claimed : Claim submitted/accepted
Matched --> Active : Match dismissed
Matched --> Removed : Admin removes
Claimed --> Resolved : Item handed over
Claimed --> Active : Claim rejected
Claimed --> Removed : Admin removes
Expired --> Active : Reporter reopens
Expired --> Removed : Admin removes
Resolved --> [*]
Removed --> [*]
@enduml
